# Context-efficient task plans

- Define each task with its goal, affected files, dependencies, and acceptance check.
- Plan with a reasoning model before implementation; keep final code out of the plan.
- Implement one task per focused chat with only this plan and the files it changes.
- Record cross-task decisions here instead of repeating broad repository context.
